# DevSpecs.md's Planning section (Locality) requires a consuming project's
# planning tickets to stay local to that project's own repository, never
# synced back here. This is a second line of defense in case a contributor
# ever runs project tooling from inside this mount by mistake.
AgentSpec/
*_DevPlanTicket.md

# The nested DevSpec repository declared in install.cgs (a plain clone, not a
# submodule). Its own checkout is never tracked by this repository.
/DevSpec/
DevSpec
